<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="content-page blog-page">
  <section class="content-hero">
    <p class="content-eyebrow">Blog</p>
    <h1>Stories, updates, and food ideas we actually care about.</h1>
    <p class="content-lead">
      Quick reads about menu highlights, ordering tips, and what we’re building next.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-grid">
    <article class="blog-card featured">
      <span class="blog-tag">Featured</span>
      <h2>How we choose the dishes we list</h2>
      <p>We focus on taste, consistency, and delivery performance so the menu stays strong, not just large.</p>
      <a href="/contact">Read more</a>
    </article>

    <article class="blog-card">
      <span class="blog-tag">Updates</span>
      <h2>New category pages are live</h2>
      <p>Burger, North Indian, Chinese, and pizza pages now follow the same clean ordering flow.</p>
      <a href="/burger">Explore menu</a>
    </article>

    <article class="blog-card">
      <span class="blog-tag">Tips</span>
      <h2>How to get faster checkout</h2>
      <p>Keep your profile ready and use the cart after login for a smoother ordering experience.</p>
      <a href="/login">Login now</a>
    </article>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
